This research submission synthesizes open-source components and conceptual 
foundations from the following projects, all reused in compliance with their 
respective licenses:

1. Streamlit Application & UI Design Concepts:
   Project: Fake News Detector
   Repository: https://github.com/kmist70/fake-news-detector
   Authors: Aryan Shine (AryoShine) & Krishna Mistry (kmist70)
   License: MIT License (Copyright (c) 2026 AryoShine)

2. CLIP Multimodal Alignment & NLI Fusion Concepts:
   Project: CLIP Multimodal Fake News Detection with InfoNCE on Fakeddit
   Repository: https://github.com/LaughingParrot/CLIP-Multimodal-Fake-News-Detection-with-InfoNCE-on-Fakeddit
   Author: Rushil Dharwal (BITS Pilani)
   License: MIT License (Copyright (c) 2026 Rushil Dharwal)

3. Pretrained Neural Encoders & Tokenizers:
   - OpenAI CLIP (ViT-B/32) via Hugging Face Transformers (MIT License)
   - DeBERTa-v3 NLI (MoritzLaurer/DeBERTa-v3-base-mnli-fever-anli) (Apache 2.0 / MIT)
   - spaCy English NLP Models (en_core_web_sm) (MIT License)
